N 51° 14.331 W 115° 29.451&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Believe it or not, this is the first time I've visited Lake Minnewanka - from the west (ie the easy drive-up way)!  I've seen it from the east.  Very beautiful.  Found with hunthikers!&lt;/p&gt;

