          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP525 Minnewanka Lake

Out with Brendan714 on a cap adventure... plan A became rain stopped play so we resorted to collecting a few on the way back to YYC. We made the detour to go grab this one. TFTC.&lt;/p&gt;

